{"id":"4ab724e3f7d0fed3","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-prop-satisfaction.md","title":"Propositional Satisfaction","display":"df-prop-satisfaction — Propositional Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-prop-satisfaction","aliases":["57-df-prop-satisfaction"],"display":"df-prop-satisfaction — Propositional Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-prop-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-prop-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prop-satisfaction — Propositional Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>、布尔公式构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\)</span> 是不含量词的布尔公式集，按下式有限深度生成。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{prop}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in Q_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\varphi\\circ\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in Q_n\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PropFml}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in Q_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\varphi\\circ\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in Q_n\\land\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PropFml}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}P&amp;\\leftrightarrow v(P)=1,\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi\\land v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi\\lor v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\to\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi\\to v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi)),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\Gamma&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}P&amp;\\leftrightarrow v(P)=1,\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi\\land v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi\\lor v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\to\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi\\to v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\psi)),\\\\\nv\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\Gamma&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nv^*&amp;:\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nv^*(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi,\\\\0,&amp;\\neg(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nv^*&amp;:\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nv^*(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi,\\\\0,&amp;\\neg(v\\models_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\varphi).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>命题真值递归的输入是无量词公式，不把未给解释的量词公式也声称为已定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$、布尔公式构造子见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$ 是不含量词的布尔公式集，按下式有限深度生成。$v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$、布尔公式构造子见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$ 是不含量词的布尔公式集，按下式有限深度生成。$v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":